Not applicable. There is no external community dependency with uncertain timing (no upstream PR/RFC the team must land). The license uncertainty is a bounded internal governance decision modeled as conditional branches, and HLR-1 explicitly blocks all shipping work until it resolves — no partial-value Tier 1 can ship without clearance.

