- Given pipeline runs against the bundled store, when runs are viewed in the Dashboard, then pipeline run status is displayed correctly, measured by an end-to-end UI check on a cluster using the bundled store (passive Dashboard validation).
- Connection defaults are validated against the bundled store endpoint exposed by the operator enablement capability.

